And Azure confirms the important limitation: **an Azure SDK cannot set a local SFTP user's ID as the owning user. Only a local SFTP user can change the owner/group to a local-user ID, and that local user needs `Modify Ownership (o)` permission.** ([Microsoft Learn][1])

