### The critical production configuration

The technical local user needs:

```text
Container: public
Permissions:
    Read
    Modify Ownership
```

For example:

```text
sftp-function-owner
        |
        +-- public
              +-- Read
              +-- Modify Ownership
```

`Modify Ownership` is exactly the Azure SFTP permission intended for changing the owning user/group. ([Microsoft Learn][1])

